{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17392","headline":"与沈十九拾遗同游栖霞寺上方於亮上人院会宿二首 二 · 权德舆","name":"与沈十九拾遗同游栖霞寺上方於亮上人院会宿二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶来人境外，心赏幸随君。\n古殿烟霞夕，深山松桂薰。\n岩花点寒溜，石磴扫春云。\n清净诸天近，喧尘下界分。\n名僧康宝月，上客沈休文。\n共宿东林夜，清猨彻曙闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}